<%# locals: (count:) %>
<%# The wrapper stays at 0 so acknowledge/unacknowledge and GenerateInsightsJob
    streams always have a target; `contents` keeps it out of layout so the chip
    still positions against the lightbulb link. Targeted by attribute because
    the layout renders the lightbulb twice (desktop header, mobile top nav).
    Unread count stays a hand-rolled inverse chip — DS::Pill's filled neutral
    tone is not theme-swapped and disappears on dark nav surfaces. %>
<span data-insights-badge class="contents"><% if count.positive? %><span class="absolute top-1 right-1 min-w-4 h-4 px-1 rounded-full bg-inverse text-inverse text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none"><%= count > 9 ? "9+" : count %></span><% end %></span>
